            %p See also:
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Manifold+Atlas"}> Manifold Atlas
                ,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://www.map.mpim-bonn.mpg.de/B-Bordism#The_Pontrjagin-Thom_isomorphism"} The Pontrjagin-Thom isomorphism
          %div
            %h3#CohomotopyInTopologicalDataAnalysisReferences Cohomotopy in topological data analysis
            %p
              Introducing
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/persistent+cohomotopy"} persistent cohomotopy
              as a tool in
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+data+analysis"} topological data analysis
